<%- include('partials/head', { title: title, description: description }) %>
<%- include('partials/nav', { active: 'services' }) %>

  <main class="page-main">
    <section class="container">
      <div class="svc-hero">
        <div class="svc-icon">📦</div>
        <h1>Services</h1>
        <p>Eight markets on one simulated balance. Pick a category to see how Global Mass Funds models it in the demo.</p>
        <div class="btn-group">
          <a href="/services/cryptocurrency" class="btn-cta-primary">Start with crypto<span>→</span></a>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-cta-ghost">Talk to a rep</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container">
      <div class="svc-grid">
        <a class="svc-card" href="/services/commodities-gold">
          <div class="svc-card-icon">🪨</div>
          <h3>Commodities &amp; Gold</h3>
          <p>Spot gold, silver and energy with the same paper balance you use everywhere else.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="svc-card" href="/services/cryptocurrency">
          <div class="svc-card-icon">₿</div>
          <h3>Cryptocurrency</h3>
          <p>Live BTC, ETH and SOL quotes with simulated order fills and a full trade ledger.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="svc-card" href="/services/real-estate">
          <div class="svc-card-icon">🏠</div>
          <h3>Real Estate</h3>
          <p>Residential, commercial and mixed-use deals modelled with cap rates and ROI.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="svc-card" href="/services/stock-etfs">
          <div class="svc-card-icon">📊</div>
          <h3>Stock &amp; ETFs</h3>
          <p>Single names, index funds and sector ETFs sized against a demo portfolio.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="svc-card" href="/services/loan">
          <div class="svc-card-icon">🧾</div>
          <h3>Loan</h3>
          <p>Practice borrowing, APR and amortization schedules before you sign anything real.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="svc-card" href="/services/card">
          <div class="svc-card-icon">💳</div>
          <h3>Card</h3>
          <p>Credit limits, grace periods and rewards — with simulated statement cycles.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="svc-card" href="/services/membership">
          <div class="svc-card-icon">🎟️</div>
          <h3>Membership ID</h3>
          <p>One access key that unlocks every market and carries your plan tier with it.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="svc-card" href="/services/staking">
          <div class="svc-card-icon">🌾</div>
          <h3>Staking</h3>
          <p>Yields, lock-ups and restaking pools modelled on real network behaviour.</p>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="svc-note">
        All eight categories share the same simulated cash balance, so a trade in crypto affects the cash available for a property or a stock position — exactly like a real portfolio.
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container">
      <div class="svc-cta">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-cta-primary">Open a demo account<span>→</span></a>
        <a href="/about" class="btn-cta-ghost">How it works</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
